weave preferences_get with key as string, on_ok as weave with v as js.JsValue into void, on_err as weave with e as js.JsValue into void into result of bool to js.JsError:
    return calling call_async with "Preferences", "get", "[{{\"key\":\"{key}\"}}]", on_ok, on_err

## `Preferences.set({ key, value })`.
##
