weave preferences_set with key as string, value as string, on_ok as weave with v as js.JsValue into void, on_err as weave with e as js.JsValue into void into result of bool to js.JsError:
    return calling call_async with "Preferences", "set", "[{{\"key\":\"{key}\",\"value\":\"{value}\"}}]", on_ok, on_err

